      "description": "The court-reminder text sender (CourtBotMessageSender) behind its Lambda function URL.\n\nPick an environment before sending, then fill in sender_url and api_key:\n  Dev (AWS)      SenderUrl and SenderApiKeySecretArn stack outputs\n  Local (Floci)  the SenderUrl output of the local stack; the key is always local-dev-key\n\nRead the outputs with:\n  aws cloudformation describe-stacks --region us-east-2 \\\n    --stack-name CourtReminderStack --query 'Stacks[0].Outputs' --output table\n  aws secretsmanager get-secret-value --region us-east-2 \\\n    --secret-id <SenderApiKeySecretArn> --query SecretString --output text\n\nThe dev key is a real credential. Keep it out of git: either fill it into a private environment (Insomnia excludes those from exports) or do not commit your filled-in copy of this file.",
